                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN ZUR ANZEIGE VON KANALSTATUSINFORMATIONEN EINES TRÄGERS UND ENDGERÄTEVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ D'INDICATION D'INFORMATIONS D'ÉTAT DE CANAL D'UNE PORTEUSE, ET DISPOSITIF TERMINAL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD FOR INDICATING CHANNEL STATE INFORMATION OF CARRIER, AND TERMINAL DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>This application discloses a carrier channel state information indicating method and a terminal device (1100), which belong to the communication field. The method includes: generating (S202, S302, S402, S502, S702) a first MAC CE, where the first MAC CE includes channel state information corresponding to one or more carrier components of a sidelink; and sending (S204, S304, S404, S504, S704) the first MAC CE to a second terminal. The first MAC CE includes multiple RI fields, there is a one-to-one correspondence between a RI field and a target bit that indicates that the first carrier component has corresponding channel state information, and the RI field corresponding to the target bit is indicated by a sequence of the target bit in the carrier component bitmap.</p>
            </abstract>
